  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida supported Straight Talk to implement its activities from 2004-2009 targeting youth in and out of school and as well as parents and teachers with a total of about 10 M SEK channelled through basket fund with other donors in support of STF strategic plans for the period,balance SEK 82,000 audit 2008/09. A completion memo indicating results and lesson learnt is kept in the archived file for STF</narrative>
  </description>
